.TH QUIPU-VALIDATE 1 "" quipu "Quipu Manual"
.SH NAME
quipu\-validate \- Validate a data file against a shapes file without writing
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquipu validate\fR [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-\-shapes\fR] [\fB\-\-data\fR] [\fB\-\-format\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Validate a data file against a shapes file without writing
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Store file (default: .bobbin/quipu/quipu.db; configuration may override it)
.TP
\fB\-\-shapes\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Shapes used for validation or packaging
.TP
\fB\-\-data\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
RDF data file to validate
.TP
\fB\-\-format\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Output or input format for this operation
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
